   "featured": true,
   "summary": "Real time network intelligence for 10,192 real Egyptian cell towers. Detects tower degradation before customers notice, and tells weather from technical faults.",
   "problem": "Telecom monitoring is usually reactive. Engineers hear about a weak tower only after customers start complaining.",
